# TMDB credential — SERVER-SIDE ONLY. Read by the /api/tmdb proxy (Vite dev/preview locally,
# netlify/functions/tmdb.mts in production). It is never bundled into browser JavaScript.
# Accepts a v3 API key (32 hex chars) or a v4 Read Access Token.
# Get one at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# Production: set TMDB_API_KEY in Netlify → Site configuration → Environment variables.
# Never use a VITE_ prefix for secrets: VITE_* variables are public (the build refuses VITE_TMDB_API_KEY).
TMDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_v3_api_key_here
